- id: '2094874812506317062'
  text: 'THIS YOUNG GUY REPLACED A $15K DESIGN AGENCY WITH ONE CLAUDE PROMPT


    or you can watch this young guy build a floating 3D product site with Claude while
    they still open Photoshop


    he asks Claude for a Three.js scene and gets a product that floats in real time
    and reacts as you scroll


    WebGL ambient occlusion gives the white on white objects real depth with soft
    shadows


    GSAP ScrollTrigger ties the camera to the scroll so the whole scene moves as you
    drag down


    the palette stays pure white so the 3D forms and the typography carry the entire
    page


    backdrop blur on the feature cards gives that frosted premium look with zero images


    requestAnimationFrame floats each element a little so the scene breathes even
    when nobody touches it


    Lenis smooth scroll makes the reveal feel like a film shot instead of a jump


    agencies charge 5k to 15k for a landing page that feels like this and he types
    it out in an afternoon


    tomorrow I break down the exact Claude prompts that spin up this whole scene from
    an empty file'
